# Apple signing material — SECRETS. Certificates, private keys and provisioning
# profiles are per-developer and per-machine: they come from the Developer
# portal or Xcode's own management, never through a repository. A .p12 in the
# history is a key anyone who can read the history can sign a release with, and
# deleting the file later does not remove it. ExportOptions.plist is generated
# per export and names the Team ID and the profile it used.
*.p12
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
App/ExportOptions.plist
App/*.ipa

# Cordova plugins for Capacitor
capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins

# Generated Config files
App/App/capacitor.config.json
App/App/config.xml
